s\n1165 |     ----------\n1166 |     remote : RemoteFileMetadata\n1167 |         Named tuple containing remote dataset meta information: url, filename\n1168 |         and checksum\n1169 | \n1170 |     dirname : string\n1171 |         Directory to save the file to.\n1172 | \n1173 |     Returns\n1174 |     -------\n1175 |     file_path: string\n1176 |         Full path of the created file.\n1177 |     \"\"\"\n1178 | \n1179 |     file_path = (remote.filename if dirname is None\n1180 |                  else join(dirname, remote.filename))\n1181 |     urlretrieve(remote.url, file_path)\n1182 |     checksum = _sha256(file_path)\n1183 |     if remote.checksum != checksum:\n1184 |         raise IOError(\"{} has an SHA256 checksum ({}) \"\n1185 |                       \"differing from expected ({}), \"\n1186 |                       \"file may be corrupted.\".format(file_path, checksum,\n1187 |                                                       remote.checksum))\n1188 |     return file_path\n```\n\nFound file `benchmarks/bench_glm.py`.\nFound file `benchmarks/bench_mnist.py`.\nFound file `benchmarks/bench_glmnet.py`.\nSource: Retrieved entity using keyword search (bm25).\nHint: Use more detailed query to get the full content of some if needed.\n\n\n\n##Searching for term \"validate\"...\n### Search Result:\nFound function `doc/tutorial/machine_learning_map/pyparsing.py:ParserElement.validate`.\nFound function `doc/tutorial/machine_learning_map/pyparsing.py:ParseExpression.validate`.\nFound function `doc/tutorial/machine_learning_map/pyparsing.py:ParseElementEnhance.validate`.\nFound function `doc/tutorial/machine_learning_map/pyparsing.py:Forward.validate`.\nSource: Match found for entity name `validate`.\nHint: Use more detailed query to get the full content of some if needed.\n\n\n\n##Searching for term \"md5 checksum\"...\n### Search Result:\nFound .\nSource: Retrieved code content using keyword search (bm25).\n```\n 40 | XY_METADATA = (\n 41 |     RemoteFileMetadata(\n